# REST Client Requests for Manual UAT
# Supported in: IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code (REST Client), Cursor, and others
# 
# To use: Click the "Send Request" link above each request, or use:
#   IntelliJ: Ctrl+Alt+E (or Cmd+Alt+E on Mac)
#   VS Code:  Ctrl+Alt+R

### RegisterBook
POST http://localhost:8080/api/book/registerbook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "sample_title_2696",
  "restricted": true
}

### MarkBookAsRestricted
POST http://localhost:8080/api/book/{bookId}/markbookasrestricted
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "550e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-0044135b92c5"
}

### Get All Book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/book

### Get Book by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/book/{bookId}

